# Path to Redemption: "{5}, Sacrifice this Aura: Exile enchanted creature. Create a 1/1 white Ally creature token. Activate only
# during your turn." The Aura is on Bot2's Ornithopter. With Mox Pearl, Black Lotus and nothing else untapped (four mana) the
# ability is refused as short; with a third Mox Pearl there are five sources, but in Bot2's turn 4 it is refused as not Bot1's
# turn. In turn 5 Black Lotus and two Mox Pearls pay exactly {5} (the pool is empty after), the Aura goes to Bot1's graveyard,
# the Ornithopter to exile and Bot1 gets the Ally.

